The state model now distinguishes operation cancellation from initiating
task termination. It requires a successful post-ack tuple revalidation
under the same live lease immediately before mutation; any intervening
event stales the revalidation. Admissions before the operation or Applying
ack are retained as pending work. Accepted supervision survives initiator
task end, while operation cancellation remains monotonic. Late publication
visibility with a supervisor is recorded but cannot override cancellation;
without an owner it remains uncertain. Known effects, Unknown and conflicts
are retained through cancellation and modeled restart.

Final scope, formatting, whitespace, documentation-link/fence, source-range
and append-only-prefix checks passed. Ordinary `sha256sum --check` was run
after appending updated artifact hashes. Its actual entry counts and the
